{"title": "Born into Darkness", "pageid": 18554, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Born_into_Darkness", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Devils_Sight.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Devils_Sight.webp/300px-Devils_Sight.webp, /w/images/5/5c/Devils_Sight.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Devils_Sight.webp/300px-Devils_Sight.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Devils_Sight.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Born into Darkness</b> is a passive feature that allows this creature to see through magical and non-magical darkness, and cannot be Blinded.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature can see through magical and non-magical darkness, and cannot be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Afara\" title=\"Afara\">Afara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Baxta\" title=\"Baxta\">Baxta</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bluenail\" title=\"Bluenail\">Bluenail</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dohna\" title=\"Dohna\">Dohna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dollay\" title=\"Dollay\">Dollay</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fredrichk\" title=\"Fredrichk\">Fredrichk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Garrigan\" title=\"Garrigan\">Garrigan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gloommask\" title=\"Gloommask\">Gloommask</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greymask\" title=\"Greymask\">Greymask</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gydd\" title=\"Gydd\">Gydd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hendly\" title=\"Hendly\">Hendly</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Humboldt\" title=\"Humboldt\">Humboldt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hyrald\" title=\"Hyrald\">Hyrald</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Imwise\" title=\"Imwise\">Imwise</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lamona\" title=\"Lamona\">Lamona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mirie\" title=\"Mirie\">Mirie</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Monteith\" title=\"Monteith\">Monteith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morann\" title=\"Morann\">Morann</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nightmist\" title=\"Nightmist\">Nightmist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Owltalon\" title=\"Owltalon\">Owltalon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Fidelian\" title=\"Sharran Fidelian\">Sharran Fidelian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Novice\" title=\"Sharran Novice\">Sharran Novice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Sentry\" title=\"Sharran Sentry\">Sharran Sentry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tylda\" title=\"Tylda\">Tylda</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Uttermask\" title=\"Uttermask\">Uttermask</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wilbur\" title=\"Wilbur\">Wilbur</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This passive is only found on Sharrans in or near the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Grief\" title=\"House of Grief\">House of Grief</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Cloister_of_Sombre_Embrace\" title=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\">Cloister of Sombre Embrace</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Despite the description, this passive also includes code which allows affected characters to ignore the effects of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fog\" title=\"Fog\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fog\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fog\" title=\"Fog\">Fog</a> as well as any condition in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(status_group)\" title=\"Blinded (status group)\">Blinded</a></span> status group.</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can see through magical and non-magical darkness, and cannot be <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">blinded</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202620\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1162/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7857/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4653/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1525/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 752931/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.139      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   52.139      1 -total\n 28.79%   15.009      3 Template:Icon_text\n 26.88%   14.014      2 Template:Icon_link\n 25.42%   13.254      1 Template:SAI\n 24.60%   12.825      6 Template:Trim\n 19.06%    9.936      3 Template:Ifempty\n 15.00%    7.820      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.18%    6.870      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n 12.93%    6.741      1 Template:SmArea\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:18554-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202620 and revision id 393574. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}